  "title": "Route schematic",
  "group": "Data display",
  "order": 23,
  "summary": {
    "en": "The stops of one trip on a line: the part already travelled in the accent, the vehicle where it is now, and the place and time under each stop. A diagram, not a map, so it stays honest and readable at any width.",
    "id": "Pemberhentian satu perjalanan di sebuah garis: bagian yang sudah ditempuh berwarna aksen, kendaraan di posisinya sekarang, dan tempat serta waktu di bawah setiap pemberhentian. Diagram, bukan peta, sehingga tetap jujur dan terbaca di lebar berapa pun."
  },
  "titleId": "Route schematic",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "A flight under way",
        "desc": "A vaccine shipment flying from Jakarta to Radin Inten II airport, 65 % of the way. The arc draws in once, then the plane settles on it, turned along the curve.",
        "html": "<div class=\"route\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\" data-lds-route='{\"label\":\"Vaccine shipment by air from Jakarta to Radin Inten II, 65 percent of the way, landing at 08:45.\",\"mode\":\"flight\",\"position\":0.65,\"stops\":[{\"name\":\"Jakarta CGK\",\"sub\":\"Left 08:00\"},{\"name\":\"Radin Inten II TKG\",\"sub\":\"Lands 08:45\"}]}'></div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "A road trip with stops",
        "desc": "A BPBD aid truck with four stops. Passed stops fill, the next one is marked in the accent, and the words under each say when.",
        "html": "<div class=\"route\" style=\"max-width: 640px;\" data-lds-route='{\"label\":\"BPBD aid truck from Bandar Lampung to Kota Agung, past Pringsewu, next stop Gisting.\",\"mode\":\"road\",\"position\":1.4,\"stops\":[{\"name\":\"BPBD warehouse, Bandar Lampung\",\"sub\":\"Loaded 15 Nov, 21:00\"},{\"name\":\"Pringsewu\",\"sub\":\"Passed 15 Nov, 22:40\"},{\"name\":\"Gisting\",\"sub\":\"Due 23:50\"},{\"name\":\"Kota Agung\",\"sub\":\"Due 16 Nov, 00:45\"}]}'></div>"
